<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-6127] Incorrect `ZEPPELIN_ANGULAR_WAR` value setup in `common.sh`</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-6127</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;When setting `ZEPPELIN_ANGULAR_WAR`, it should check for the `${ZEPPELIN_HOME}/zeppelin-web-angular/dist/zeppelin` directory.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;However, it currently checks for the `&lt;tt&gt;${ZEPPELIN_HOME}/zeppelin-web/dist`&lt;/tt&gt; directory, causing an issue where the new UI load fails if the classic UI is not built.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
